WEBVTT

00:28:27.919 --> 00:28:30.326
that's the definition of inauthentic.

00:28:30.350 --> 00:28:32.246
Just ask Alicia Menendez.

00:28:32.270 --> 00:28:34.316
It's happened to her multiple times.

00:28:34.340 --> 00:28:38.696
Alicia Menendez: I was told
that I needed to, like, liven up my look

00:28:38.720 --> 00:28:41.736
and get some T-shirts,
and some leather jackets

00:28:41.760 --> 00:28:44.003
and wear the things
that the kids were wearing.

00:28:44.027 --> 00:28:48.646
And I was somehow supposed to become

00:28:48.670 --> 00:28:51.846
that edgy, hip, cool person,

00:28:51.870 --> 00:28:56.926
instead of just being my, you know,
30-something dorky self.

00:28:56.950 --> 00:28:59.296
AG: Alicia is now an anchor at MSNBC

00:28:59.320 --> 00:29:01.486
and the author of "The Likability Trap,"